# Each service also carries its own .gitignore. These are the repository-wide
# rules, plus a deliberate safety net: the patterns below are repeated here so
# that a missing or truncated sub-gitignore cannot let dependencies or build
# output into a commit again.

.DS_Store
*.log

# Dependencies and build output, wherever they appear.
node_modules/
dist/
bin/

# Coverage: the raw Go profile is an intermediate and stays out. The rendered
# reports are committed deliberately so they can be reviewed without cloning
# and running the suites — see COVERAGE.md.
coverage.out

# Local environment overrides. The committed .env.example files are the
# documentation; real values never belong in the repository.
.env
.env.local
.env.*.local
